{"2187390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Conqueror of the Seas", "steam_appid": 2187390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Wind, Control the Battle.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Conqueror of the Seas</i>, every battle is a test of skill, where the wind drives your movement and your aim decides survival. Victory is not given — it is earned through positioning, timing, and mastery of the sea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Naval Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget simple point-and-shoot combat. Align your ship for the perfect broadside. Control your aim with precision and timing. Build focus to tighten your shots and unleash devastating volleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish mistakes — or be punished. Victory belongs to the better captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/39b8aa8cfbbff1b616bd4490cd870e7a.poster.avif?t=1781720385\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/39b8aa8cfbbff1b616bd4490cd870e7a.webm?t=1781720385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/39b8aa8cfbbff1b616bd4490cd870e7a.mp4?t=1781720385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Wind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea is alive — and it will not favour the careless. Use the wind to gain speed and maneuver advantage. Outflank slower opponents and control engagement angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right position can decide the battle before the first cannon fires.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon demands skill, every encounter offers risk and reward. Choose your tools — and use them wisely. Bring destruction to your enemies with a diverse arsenal:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons to deliver devastating volleys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire arrows to cripple sails and crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek fire and barrel bombs to spread chaos across enemy decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/8483f6a3d367fc8b7fe858b69924f756.poster.avif?t=1781720385\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/8483f6a3d367fc8b7fe858b69924f756.webm?t=1781720385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/8483f6a3d367fc8b7fe858b69924f756.mp4?t=1781720385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are not decided by firepower alone. The Ottoman and Byzantine fleets clash for dominance — and only those who control the sea will prevail.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture strategic locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold key positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your fleet and overwhelm your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War isn’t won by a single ship — but by control of the sea. Seize key positions, break enemy formations, and turn every engagement to your advantage. Victory belongs to those who shape the battle before it begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/1a4d2c3481898fd4c3f1f83fb11135af.poster.avif?t=1781720385\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/1a4d2c3481898fd4c3f1f83fb11135af.webm?t=1781720385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187390/extras/1a4d2c3481898fd4c3f1f83fb11135af.mp4?t=1781720385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Holy Reinforcements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of war through divine intervention. When the seas burn and empires falter, call upon <strong>Holy Reinforcements</strong> to rally your side:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crusade:</strong> Summon Christian holy fleets to strike in the name of the Cross.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jihad:</strong> Unleash Ottoman reinforcements blessed for holy war.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash colossal <strong>support galleons</strong> carrying devastating firepower, vital supplies, and elite warriors into the heart of battle — a desperate last stand… or the beginning of total victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise as a Legendary Captain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience and reputation by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >winning naval battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >capturing strategic flags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >leading your crew to glory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful <strong>captain abilities</strong>, strengthen <strong>your ship</strong>, and rise through <strong>the ranks</strong> to become a <strong>legendary captain</strong> feared across the seas and carve your name into the history of the Mediterranean!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", 